      <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-nv-border bg-nv-surface p-6">
        <p class="text-sm text-nv-text-muted">Full article coming soon. Browse our <a href="/names/islamic" class="font-semibold text-nv-accent hover:underline">Islamic names directory</a> for meanings and origins.</p>
